  <item nodeId="node-360">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Hallway&#x000A;A drab hallway. The paint is peeling from the walls and the floor creaks beneath your feet. To the east the elevator doors are open, waiting for you to enter as if by fate. To the north is an old, rickety door that you know leads to the stairwell, enemy of your weak calves and smoke drenched lungs.&#x000A;&#x000A;A fly buzzes around your face. You swat at it but you move too slowly.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-361"/>
      <child nodeId="node-366"/>
      <child nodeId="node-368"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-361">
    <command xml:space="preserve">e</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Elevator&#x000A;The elevator groans as you climb aboard. It is just as out-of-order as it has been for the past three years that you've been leasing this office. Did I forget to mention that?&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-362"/>
    </children>
  </item>
