  <item nodeId="node-364">
    <command xml:space="preserve">s</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Investigator's Office&#x000A;A picturesque PI's office. Venetian blinds, a dense cloud of cigar smoke settled at eye level, and a desk that is littered with litter with a chair standing beside. On the desk is not two, not three, but one opened bottle of whiskey and a single apple.  Oh! And there's a door to the north that leads to a hallway.&#x000A;&#x000A;On the desk are a bottle of whiskey (closed) and an apple.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can also see a chair and a bookshelf (in which are a few books) here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
