    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-365">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Hallway&#x000A;A drab hallway. The paint is peeling from the walls and the floor creaks beneath your feet. To the east the elevator doors are open, waiting for you to enter as if by fate. To the north is an old, rickety door that you know leads to the stairwell, enemy of your weak calves and smoke drenched lungs.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** Your head splits open. Your thirst for liquor dominating your senses. You cannot go on. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
