    <command xml:space="preserve">i</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You are carrying:&#x000A;  an old key&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-409">
    <command xml:space="preserve">take old key</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Taken.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-410"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-410">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Hallway&#x000A;A drab hallway. The paint is peeling from the walls and the floor creaks beneath your feet. To the east the elevator doors are open, waiting for you to enter as if by fate. To the north is an old, rickety door that you know leads to the stairwell, enemy of your weak calves and smoke drenched lungs.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-411"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-411">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(first unlocking the rickety door with the old key, then opening the door)&#x000A;You enter into the stairwell. You take a deep, ragged breath. Your body has already begun to ache in anticipation of your going down the stairs.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You go down the stairs. On to another adventure. Another mystery. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
